### 🏠 1. TEST - Obtener información de la API
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 📋 2. TEST - Obtener todos los ejercicios (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises

### 👤 3. TEST - Registrar nuevo usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Test User",
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### 🔑 4. TEST - Login (OBTENER TOKEN AQUÍ)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### 💪 5. TEST - Crear workout (PARA USUARIO ACTUAL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/workouts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Mi Primer Workout",
    "exercises": [
        {
            "exerciseId": 1,
            "sets": 3,
            "reps": 10,
            "weight": 50
        }
    ],
    "notes": "Workout de prueba"
}

### 📋 6. TEST - Obtener workouts del usuario
GET {{baseUrl}}/workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📅 7. TEST - Crear schedule
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedules
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "workoutId": 1,
    "scheduledDate": "2025-09-28T18:00:00Z",
    "notes": "Sesión de tarde"
}

### 📊 8. TEST - Obtener schedules
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🔄 9. TEST - PUT - Actualización completa de usuario
