Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Test User Updated",
    "email": "test.updated@example.com"
}

### 🔧 10. TEST - PATCH - Actualización parcial de usuario
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Test User Partial Update"
}

### 🔄 11. TEST - PUT - Actualización completa de workout (USAR ID CORRECTO)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/workouts/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Mi Primer Workout - COMPLETO",
    "exercises": [
        {
            "exerciseId": 1,
            "sets": 5,
            "reps": 12,
            "weight": 60
        },
        {
            "exerciseId": 2,
            "sets": 4,
            "reps": 10,
            "weight": 40
        }
    ],
    "notes": "Workout completamente actualizado",
    "scheduledDate": "2025-09-29T10:00:00Z"
}

